---
source: crates/fauxfield/tests/cli.rs
expression: out
---
Write MCP client config and an AGENTS.md section for this Workspace

Usage: fauxfield agents init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --claude            Configure Claude Code (.mcp.json)
  -q, --quiet             Suppress informational output
      --codex             Configure Codex (.codex/config.toml)
      --no-color          Disable coloured output (also honoured: the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --cursor            Configure Cursor (.cursor/mcp.json)
  -y, --yes               Write without asking
      --dry-run           Print the diff and exit; nothing is written
      --allow <ALLOW>     Tool classes the agent may use: read, write, execute [default: read write execute]
      --command <PATH>    Command written into the client config (default: `fauxfield`; use an absolute path when the binary is not on PATH)
  -w, --workspace <PATH>  Workspace folder (default: the nearest ancestor containing fauxfield.toml, else the current directory)
      --json              Machine-readable output with a stable schema
  -h, --help              Print help
